### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### media-analysis.http — what is left on the media resource (ADR-068 §5)
### Validates the RAG search endpoint. The analyze endpoints
### (POST /media/analyze/{image,audio,video}) are DELETED: analysis is a run of the
### matching orazaka-media Studio, covered by studio-runs.http. POST /media/upload
### stays — uploading an asset is not a capability invocation — and is exercised by
### StudioLifecycleIT, which uploads before running an analysis Studio.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Authenticate
# @name login
POST {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

?? status == 200

###

### RAG Search — knowledge retrieval surface
# @name ragSearch
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/media/search?q=orazaka
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.token}}

?? status == 200
